                  <nc xml:id="m-9700b7a2-3e49-4c47-b50e-62840c4d39e6" pname="g" oct="3" /><nc xml:id="m-c5dfcd21-5729-4667-b4c1-8c1bef881530" pname="e" oct="3" /></neume></syllable></layer></staff><div xml:id="m-d8e0d817-0cb2-4492-be4f-378d9631ebb3"><lg xml:id="m-9d91602d-ec98-458b-899a-25a77acde52b"><l xml:id="m-b8eee3c1-3667-4c32-b590-d9361d3e4c44" facs="#m-245674aa-1045-4ae1-b362-58942867fcd9" label="text-like">Proper feasts of U. S. A.</l><l xml:id="m-b8f936c9-e5a0-4c7b-a712-217a43df0671" facs="#m-a092d399-eacf-4f79-b697-7d77cdade74f" label="ambiguous">(32)</l><l xml:id="m-28c9a4cc-fc05-468a-87db-81cf1aaaa83b" facs="#m-a4bf69e1-6e50-4479-9d69-25fdb15cffc4" label="ambiguous">MAY 16</l><l xml:id="m-9ee99cd2-56e1-4a49-a82c-9a3b1a38b76d" facs="#m-76740653-b684-4ca6-bf98-e7529d378159" label="ambiguous">St. John Nepomucene, Martyr</l><l xml:id="m-578e93cb-0e17-4ed5-a01c-1dcbb4a86dca" facs="#m-17d96005-da5f-4c73-90fd-22940f5739ff" label="ambiguous">II class</l><l xml:id="m-7b9d63a3-3c52-4d70-82fb-17cffe20fbec" facs="#m-a901751b-1776-4551-b6d7-e3d21583fb35" label="ambiguous">In some dioceses</l><l xml:id="m-a0131c51-180c-4ce7-8e9b-70a40776d13b" facs="#m-0f0b49ab-5c70-42f7-8995-41f3d71c6627" label="text-like">Mass. Protexisti. p. 1145, except the Collect:</l><l xml:id="m-dc9dc52b-c5de-4bde-92f1-e810bfeff1bc" facs="#m-551f5ca9-30f9-4adc-80d3-445386e2abf4" label="ambiguous">Collect</l><l xml:id="m-9d85425a-9fb8-4973-a9c7-f53a5685453d" facs="#m-6c588a71-e998-452b-bc7c-e92e37cf64b0" label="lyrics-like">Eus, qui ob invictum beáti ]linguam caute custodire; *ac</l><l xml:id="m-0b8490ce-de46-4d83-8ecb-dd61229aa8d4" facs="#m-e11a91bc-629d-4dd4-ad2a-273339b1c0e6" label="lyrics-like">I Joánnis sacramentále silén-ómnia pótius mala quam ánimae</l><l xml:id="m-de06bd04-764c-4f39-a94d-62303dea831c" facs="#m-2effa893-8830-4229-ac33-19927d3139db" label="lyrics-like">tium nova Ecclésiam tuam mar-detriméntum in hoc saéculo tole¬</l><l xml:id="m-46404920-dcec-4040-a2d9-cbca376aaef4" facs="#m-e3d2bd7c-22b8-4cb9-83cd-eef83a68b6dd" label="lyrics-like">tyrii coróna decorásti:t da nobis ráre. Per Dóminum nostrum Je¬</l><l xml:id="m-c1dbb85f-538d-456e-825b-2352a04b774c" facs="#m-9ef33aac-75b0-4d7c-9b97-cdb33adf7ffc" label="lyrics-like">ejus intercessióne et exémplo, sum Christum.</l><l xml:id="m-64b7e76a-0ef7-447d-bfc3-b8f84187a01d" facs="#m-96a5dad4-a46b-4526-baa6-70b868e27015" label="lyrics-like">Secret. Munéribus nostris. p. 1138, and Postcommunion. Da,</l><l xml:id="m-d6737bdf-4e04-43f5-9742-cf9c8ea5626d" facs="#m-b97742a6-1660-42d3-94fe-3dbd426e2873" label="lyrics-like">quaésumus. p. 1138.</l><l xml:id="m-6ec11468-e0fe-4b03-bf1e-5e2bcdb4cb4f" facs="#m-6cedd6f0-23a0-4d20-81f8-6d97f155344d" label="text-like">In some other dioceses:</l><l xml:id="m-50e4db4e-90d6-4648-85b4-c6409e21d947" facs="#m-84617f63-19ab-44bd-ba84-1b05a4c9e096" label="ambiguous">Secret</l><l xml:id="m-efa67ebb-1a80-408b-abbf-301ed7d1687c" facs="#m-6e708170-f79e-47b5-a193-b9d4a8d87d7b" label="lyrics-like">ÆC tua, Dómine, sacra my-l inclytus Martyr et Sacérdos tuus</l><l xml:id="m-49700891-f858-45fb-9d99-9535fa291fe9" facs="#m-47a587f6-aea1-461c-b309-1d70e88e8afc" label="lyrics-like">It stéria ilium in nobis, quaésu¬</l><l xml:id="m-2c8bce37-5886-402e-be5a-bbfdeb701c25" facs="#m-b2a6312b-19bb-41ef-870d-d4ae586d2619" label="lyrics-like">Joánnes, ea peragéndo, flagrábat.</l><l xml:id="m-68513e11-917b-4a36-8562-be5855702798" facs="#m-5aa7e421-d869-4a9d-8678-097b4ded380d" label="lyrics-like">mus, ignem accéndant: quo Per Dóminum nostrum.</l><l xml:id="m-12055025-cda3-4565-9793-5dc051c2cd35" facs="#m-c01a25bd-3ad6-487a-9bb2-b62705b51577" label="ambiguous">Postcommunion</l><l xml:id="m-f5662885-ae7b-4088-b99b-dc469ed82f13" facs="#m-112585cf-e431-44b0-afcb-d4406e31f6f4" label="lyrics-like">L'Ragilitátem nostram, Dómi- Joánnis tentátam contra honó¬</l><l xml:id="m-670f24cb-c6b2-46b5-879b-825d2feff49d" facs="#m-b9514bfd-f844-4a57-a40b-3d8bec9c7f10" label="lyrics-like">1 ne, caeléstis haec mensa rem sacraménti constántiam,</l><l xml:id="m-25117868-3ac5-45e0-a6a8-cc143dff5720" facs="#m-cb268771-1766-4649-8351-f2eb52e83dc0" label="lyrics-like">fórtium pane confirmet: qui júgiter áluit ad victóriam. Per</l><l xml:id="m-2207b319-4199-48d4-b248-a0515006b4aa" facs="#m-5d5e3e6c-a875-44dd-ba10-f3568f019bb2" label="lyrics-like">beáti Mártyris et Sacerdótis tui Dóminum nostrum.</l><l xml:id="m-fee3c434-ea7c-4a25-b183-51a1cc91a6f5" facs="#m-3dc4f721-a1bb-4e6b-a4b9-f494c332f531" label="ambiguous">MAY 16</l><l xml:id="m-a2704a36-66c3-4448-a9ad-64808eda31c7" facs="#m-3b952640-e172-445b-80f4-71647d14a9bd" label="ambiguous">St. Brendan, Abbot</l><l xml:id="m-92347695-38b5-4f64-9803-b2bc10519bd7" facs="#m-108f433a-b803-41d9-8e80-084cd50ff8f3" label="ambiguous">III class</l><l xml:id="m-f444b17e-bc90-42db-97ec-90d5bcdef5d6" facs="#m-7eb30681-190d-46f9-a1a3-7e4db6952290" label="lyrics-like">Mass. Os jústi, from the Common of an Abbot, p. 1206.</l><l xml:id="m-eb4bd360-4296-4482-99b2-322fa37a1ef8" facs="#m-78e1a9b1-bfc6-4b62-8366-5a380cad7434" label="ambiguous">MAY 22</l><l xml:id="m-a6e4aa4d-f0a8-4e25-bb61-73d1e1e3aab5" facs="#m-ab7c5976-541c-4f1f-afba-3240374a1c75" label="text-like">St. Rita of Cascia, Widow</l><l xml:id="m-e5b3ed9b-5d0a-4885-b2c3-cf6e2a2beb12" facs="#m-f353b733-c7e1-4389-a1ab-8b757f13ee22" label="ambiguous">II class</l><l xml:id="m-a6d26a69-01f7-4703-a144-d01190f5d612" facs="#m-ce6f2bf1-df4e-477c-bd4d-327ede5f13d1" label="text-like">In the diocese of Los Angeles</l><l xml:id="m-0c88ef44-c0a6-4edb-8b3f-4ad1eee46a4c" facs="#m-a18f43ee-62b6-4ec4-a09f-522999a416fd" label="text-like">AT MASS</l><l xml:id="m-32d50a47-d953-4d49-8dd0-55ad61d3e559" facs="#m-6f1f00de-e930-4969-9199-251ddd3a7edc" label="ambiguous">Intr.</l><l xml:id="m-37b91b11-767f-4048-aa78-5c3f87cb56cf" facs="#m-efbb6d0f-037e-42b9-b44e-c87c6649d03e" label="ambiguous">3.</l><l xml:id="m-cf7287a7-57e7-4a5d-8a23-4876c4168aea" facs="#m-1f998e1f-5c7b-4f81-a0fb-18314b7ccfe0" label="lyrics-like">-pe-ríte* mí- hi pór-tas justí-ti-ae,</l><l xml:id="m-a391a274-6a0f-4650-a93f-29af3ab43f95" facs="#m-16cc4fc7-7497-44f7-a7bb-7deab0a09d50" label="ambiguous">in¬</l><l xml:id="m-96141331-cc77-4192-a8d6-b9098f955bfb" facs="#m-3aa06abd-d50f-4859-aac9-daea378d58a1" label="lyrics-like">lá-pi¬</l><l xml:id="m-005c1b7e-9386-4b80-bca8-01278a494972" facs="#m-2ca8852b-8177-41bf-8af0-459ee6cbc6fa" label="lyrics-like">con-fi-té-bor Dó- mino:</l><l xml:id="m-262a7cbe-5c6a-4ad4-865b-b9343c705f62" facs="#m-970a9e9c-ef1f-4527-bc97-18dd2dbd761e" label="lyrics-like">grés-sus in é¬ as</l></lg></div></section></score></mdiv></body></music>
</mei>